Changes made to the source material
-----------------------------------

CC BY 4.0 requires derivative works to indicate what was changed:

  * Text normalised — Unicode NFC, whitespace runs collapsed to a single space,
    zero-width joiners and non-joiners (U+200D, U+200C) removed.
  * 89 of 5,142 lines removed — 13 with empty transcriptions, and 76 whose
    ground-truth bounding box is too narrow to accommodate the number of
    characters its transcription claims.
  * Line geometry altered — crop padding changed from the source bounding boxes
    to a height-proportional pad (55% above, 25% below, clamped to neighbouring
    lines), because the source boxes exclude the superscript vowel marks.

No page images from the source dataset are redistributed in this repository.
